                    <description>&lt;p&gt;the option minSupport is added with a capital S&lt;br/&gt;
   addOption(&quot;minSupport&quot;, &quot;s&quot;, &quot;(Optional) Minimum Support. Default Value: &quot;&lt;/p&gt;

